  "title": "30th Annual Kids Golf Classic Raises Record $349,400",
  "summary": "For the 30th consecutive year, members of the local business and golf communities came together for United Bank’s annual Kids Golf Classic tournament, benefiting the Boys & Girls Club of Parkersburg. The fundraising event, held at the Parkersburg Country Club, garnered a record-breaking $349,400 this year, surpassing 2025’s record by over $6,000. All funds raised directly impact the more than 1,000 kids throughout the Mid-Ohio Valley that the Boys & Girls Club serves each year.",
